  "body": "--------------------------Christmas Special----------------------------------\r\n\r\n4 Beds 3 Baths Terrace House - 11 Irwin Lane - Asking Price $1,129,000\r\nBrand-New End Terrace House - 9 Irwin Lane - Asking Price $1,189,000\r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to secure a 4 bedrooms 3 bathrooms home in the sought-after Milenio Residence community at a special Christmas price.\r\n\r\nPositioned in the heart of Mairangi Bay / Rosedale, this freehold and architecturally designed townhouse offers modern family living in a highly convenient North Shore location, with excellent school zones and easy access to local amenities.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n- 4 bedrooms\r\n- 3 bathrooms, including master ensuite\r\n- Internal access garage\r\n- Approx. 159m² floor area including balcony\r\n- Modern designer kitchen\r\n- Open-plan living and dining\r\n- Great indoor-outdoor flow\r\n- Freehold title\r\n\r\nThis well-designed home offers comfortable, low-maintenance living with light-filled interiors and a practical layout to suit families, professionals or buyers seeking a quality new-build in a strong location.\r\n\r\nSchool Zones:\r\n- Rangitoto College\r\n- Westlake Girls High School\r\n- Murrays Bay Intermediate\r\n- Mairangi Bay School\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\nEnjoy the convenience of being just minutes from Mairangi Bay Beach, with easy access to Albany, motorway connections, shopping and a wide range of North Shore amenities.\r\n\r\nMilenio is a growing master-planned community developed by Oakland Group, with future stages integrating residential living with the Milenio Business Park, including retail, cafés, hospitality and office space.\r\n\r\nPurchase directly from the developer and secure your new home with confidence.\r\n\r\nOpen Home / Viewing:\r\nCall AMBER on 021 185 6188 to arrange a private viewing anytime, or come to our Open Home at 9 Irwin Lane, Saturday 11am–12pm.",
